IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wra1-three-valued`

§ `Tests: the three-valued helpers (technical; they are not provisions)`

-- expected values are the Kleene truth tables, written by hand
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 3(1) both of these are true` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 19(2) either of these is true` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 4(1)(d) the opposite of this` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 4(1)(d) the opposite of this` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 4(1)(d) the opposite of this` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
